<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT ENGLAND BY 131 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT ENGLAND BY 131 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat England by 131 runs</p>
<p>in the third and final one day international at Harare Sports</p>
<p>Club on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 249-7 in 50 overs. England 118 all out in</p>
<p>30 overs.</p>
<p>Zimbabwe won series 3-0.</p>
</text>
